{"version":1,"content":"<p>譚耀文昨晚（25日）出席頒獎活動，譚耀文表示去年出道以來，首次舉行演唱會，雖然場地細已很滿足，但相信歌手一定要去到紅館先得，仍要努力為這個目標進發，「始終舊年先開始撻番副偈。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:41:12.613392+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T08:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T00:58:11.051385+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T08:38:05.787599+00:00","content_hash":"a2e26a246310a52e2f35dde9b628d1f7613c20575a0d91aac26ddbb5ab7e83e1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}